# text = It appears , at first sight not unreasonable to suppose , that , if he had entertained a becoming feeling of respect for the prediction of the gentleman in the white waistcoat , he would have established that sage individual's prophetic character , once and for ever , by tying one end of his pocket-handkerchief to a hook in the wall , and attaching himself to the other .
