# text = Sowerberry emerged from a little room behind the shop , and presented the form of a short , then , squeezed-up woman , with a vixenish countenance said Mr . Sowerberry , deferentially Oliver bowed again said the undertaker's wife replied Mr . Bumble : looking at Oliver as if it were his fault that he was no bigger replied the lady pettishly With this , the undertaker's wife opened a side door , and pushed Oliver down a steep flight of stairs into a stone cell , damp and dark : forming the ante-room to the coal-cellar , and denominated ' kitchen '; wherein sat a slatternly girl , in shoes down at heel , and blue worsted stockings very much out of repair said Mr . Sowerberry , who had followed Oliver down Oliver , whose eyes had glistened at the mention of meat , and who was trembling with eagerness to devour it , replied in the negative ; and a plateful of coarse broken victuals was set before him .
