# text = Half an hour after breakfast next morning , Mr . Bumble entered the shop ; and supporting his cane against the counter , drew forth his large leathern pocket-book : from which he selected a small scrap of paper , which he handed over to Sowerberry said the undertaker , glancing over it with a lively countenance replied Mr . Bumble , fastening the strap of the leathern pocket-book : which , like himself , was very corpulent said the undertaker , looking from the scrap of paper to Mr . Bumble Bumble shook his head , as he replied exclaimed Mr . Sowerberry with a sneer replied the beadle asquiesced the undertaker said the beadle ; ' and we shouldn't have known anything about them , then , only a woman who lodges in the same house made an application to the porochial committee for them to send the porochial surgeon to see a woman as was very bad .
