# text = He needn't haven taken the trouble to shrink from Mr . Bumble's glance , however ; for that functionary , on whom the prediction of the gentleman in the white waistcoat had made a very strong impression , thought that now the undertaker had got Oliver upon trial the subject was better avoided , until such time as he should be firmly bound for seven years , and all danger of his being returned upon the hands of the parish should be thus effectually and legally overcome said Mr . Sowerberry , taking up his hat Oliver obeyed , and followed his master on his professional mission .
