# text = For instance ; when Sowerberry had an order for the burial of some rich old lady or gentleman , who was surrounded by a great number of nephews and nieces , who had been perfectly inconsolable during the previous illness , and whose grief had been wholly irrepressible even on the most public occasions , they would be as happy among themselves as need be -- quite cheerful and contented -- conversing together with as much freedom and gaiety , as if nothing whatever had happened to disturb them .
