# text = Intent upon this innocent amusement , Noah put his feet on the table-cloth ; and pulled Oliver's hair ; and twitched his ears ; and expressed his opinion that he was a ' sneak '; and furthermore announced his intention of coming to see him hanged , whenever that desirable event should take place ; and entered upon various topics of petty annoyance , like a malicious and ill-conditioned charity-boy as he was .
