# text = Having rested here , for a minute or so , to collect a good burst of sobs and an imposing show of tears and terror , he knocked loudly at the wicket ; and presented such a rueful face to the aged pauper who opened it , that even he , who saw nothing but rueful faces about him at the best of times , started back in astonishment said the old pauper cried Noah , with well-affected dismay : and in tones so loud and agitated , that they not only caught the ear of Mr .
