# text = The follow touched his hat with a grin , expecting something for his pains ; but , the old gentleman , eyeing him with an expression of dislike , look anxiously round , as if he contemplated running away himself : which it is very possible he might have attempted to do , and thus have afforded another chase , had not a police officer ( who is generally the last person to arrive in such cases ) at that moment made his way through the crowd , and seized Oliver by the collar said the man , roughly said Oliver , clasping his hands passionately , and looking round said the officer .
