# text = Oliver looked very worn and shadowy from sickness , and made an ineffectual attempt to stand up , out of respect to his benefactor , which terminated in his sinking back into the chair again ; and the fact is , if the truth must be told , that Mr . Brownlow's heart , being large enough for any six ordinary old gentlemen of humane disposition , forced a supply of tears into his eyes , by some hydraulic process which we are not sufficiently philosophical to be in a condition to explain said Mr . Brownlow , clearing his throat said Mrs .
