# text = Sikes , filling his glass , and smiting the table with his enormous fist While these , and many other encomiums , were being passed on the accomplished Nancy , that young lady made the best of her way to the police-office ; whither , notwithstanding a little natural timidity consequent upon walking through the streets alone and unprotected , she arrived in perfect safety shortly afterwards .
