# text = Mr . Bill Sikes no sooner heard the account of the expedition delivered , than he very hastily called up the white dog , and , putting on his hat , expeditiously departed : without devoting any time to the formality of wishing the company good-morning said the Jew greatly excited added the Jew , unlocking a drawer with a shaking hand With these words , he pushed them from the room : and carefully double-locking and barring the door behind them , drew from its place of concealment the box which he had unintentionally disclosed to Oliver .
