# text = Possibly , if he had observed the brief interchange of signals , he might have thought that it boded no good to him inquired Fagin ; speaking , now that that Sikes was looking on , without raising his eyes from the ground replied Barney ; whose words : whether they came from the heart or not : made their way through the nose inquired Fagin , in a tone of surprise : which perhaps might mean that Barney was at liberty to tell the truth replied Barney exclaimed Sikes replied Barney said Sikes , pouring out a glass of liquor Barney looked timidly at Fagin , as if for permission ; the Jew remaining silent , and not lifting his eyes from the ground , he retired ; and presently returned , ushering in Nancy ; who was decorated with the bonnet , apron , basket , and street-door key , complete inquired Sikes , proffering the glass replied the young lady , disposing of its contents said Fagin , looking up .
