# text = The housebreaker flung the girl from him to the further end of the room , just as the Jew and the two boys returned , dragging Oliver among them said Fagin , looking round replied Sikes , savagely said Nancy , pale and breathless from the scuffle said the Jew , with a threatening look replied Nancy , speaking very loud Mr . Fagin was sufficiently well acquainted with the manners and customs of that particular species of humanity to which Nancy belonged , to feel tolerably certain that it would be rather unsafe to prolong any conversation with her , at present .
