# text = The girl laughed again : even less composedly than before ; and , darting a hasty look at Sikes , turned her face aside , and bit her lip till the blood came added Sikes , as he surveyed her with a contemptuous air cried the girl passionately said the Jew appealing to him in a remonstratory tone , and motioning towards the boys , who were eagerly attentive to all that passed cried the girl , whose passion was frightful to see pointing to Oliver replied the Jew , with an attempt at pacification returned the girl ; not speaking , but pouring out the words in one continuous and vehement scream interposed the Jew , goaded by these reproaches
