# text = The girl said nothing more ; but , tearing her hair and dress in a transport of passion , made such a rush at the Jew as would probably have left signal marks of her revenge upon him , had not her wrists been seized by Sikes at the right moment ; upon which , she made a few ineffectual struggles , and fainted said Sikes , laying her down in a corner The Jew wiped his forehead : and smiled , as if it were a relief to have the disturbance over ; but neither he , nor Sikes , nor the dog , nor the boys , seemed to consider it in any other light than a common occurance incidental to business said the Jew , replacing his club inquired Charley Bates replied the Jew , reciprocating the grin with which Charley put the question .
