# text = One afternoon , the Dodger and Master Bates being engaged out that evening , the first-named young gentleman took it into his head to evince some anxiety regarding the decoration of his person ( to do him justice , this was by no means an habitual weakness with him ); and , with this end and aim , he condescendingly commanded Oliver to assist him in his toilet , straightway .
