# text = Would you go and be dependent on your friends said Master Bates : drawing two or three silk handkerchiefs from his pocket , and tossing them into a cupboard said the Dodger , with an air of haughty disgust said Oliver with a half smile rejoined the Dodger , with a wave of his pipe , ' That was all out of consideration for Fagin Master Bates nodded assent , and would have spoken , but the recollection of Oliver's flight came so suddenly upon him , that the smoke he was inhaling got entangled with a laugh , and went up into his head , and down into his throat : and brought on a fit of coughing and stamping , about five minutes long said the Dodger , drawing forth a handful of shillings and halfpence inquired Charley Bates replied Oliver said Charly .
