# text = It was a meanly furnished apartment , with nothing but the contents of the closet to induce the belief that its occupier was anything but a working man ; and with no more suspicious articles displayed to view than two or three heavy bludgeons which stood in a corner , and a ' life-preserver ' that hung over the chimney-piece said Sikes , smacking his lips inquired the Jew replied Sikes said the Jew , drawing his chair forward , and speaking in a very low voice inquired Sikes said the Jew sneered Mr . Sikes said the Jew , who had in vain attempted to stop this burst of indignation said Sikes But as Mr . Sikes DID care , on reflection , he dropped his voice as he said the words , and grew calmer said the Jew , coaxingly said the Jew : rubbing his hands , and elevating his eyebrows in a rapture of anticipation replied Sikes coldly echoed the Jew , leaning back in his chair rejoined Sikes said the Jew , turning pale with anger retorted Sikes said the Jew : softening as the other grew heated replied Sikes remonstrated the Jew replied Sikes said the Jew incredulously replied Sikes said the Jew rejoined Sikes The Jew looked blank at this information .
