# text = He was a trifle above the middle size , and apparently rather weak in the legs ; but this circumstance by no means detracted from his own admiration of his top-boots , which he contemplated , in their elevated situation , with lively satisfaction said this figure , turning his head towards the door Uttering this exclamation in a tone of great surprise , as his eyes rested on Oliver , Mr . Toby Crackit brought himself into a sitting posture , and demanded who that was replied Sikes , drawing a chair towards the fire exclaimed Barney , with a grin exclaimed Toby , looking at Oliver interposed Sikes , impatiently ; and stooping over his recumbant friend , he whispered a few words in his ear : at which Mr . Crackit laughed immensely , and honoured Oliver with a long stare of astonishment said Sikes , as he resumed his seat Oliver looked at Sikes , in mute and timid wonder ; and drawing a stool to the fire , sat with his aching head upon his hands , scarecely knowing where he was , or what was passing around him said Toby , as the young Jew placed some fragments of food , and a bottle upon the table He rose to honour the toast ; and , carefully depositing his empty pipe in a corner , advanced to the table , filled a glass with spirits , and drank off its contents .
