# text = This was no sooner done , than Sikes , mounting upon him , put Oiver gently through the window with his feet first ; and , without leaving hold of his collar , planted him safely on the floor inside said Sikes , looking into the room Oliver , more dead than alive , gasped out Sikes , pointing to the street-door with the pistol-barrel , briefly advised him to take notice that he was within shot all the way ; and that if he faltered , he would fall dead that instant said Sikes , in the same low whisper whispered the other man .
