# text = The flame threw a ghastly light on their shrivelled faces , and made their ugliness appear terrible , as , in this position , they began to converse in a low voice inquired the messenger replied the other demanded the first rejoined the other Looking cautiously round , to ascertain that they were not overheard , the two hags cowered nearer to the fire , and chuckled heartily said the first speaker rejoined the other Stretching forth her trembling fingers as she spoke , the old creature shook them exultingly before her face , and fumbling in her pocket , brought out an old time-discoloured tin snuff-box , from which she shook a few grains into the outstretched palm of her companion , and a few more into her own .
