# text = While they were thus employed , the matron , who had been impatiently watching until the dying woman should awaken from her stupor , joined them by the fire , and sharply asked how long she was to wait replied the second woman , looking up into her face said the matron sternly answered the first woman added the second one said the matron , snappishly She was bouncing away , when a cry from the two women , who had turned towards the bed , caused her to look round .
