# text = She was bending eagerly over the woman to hear her reply ; but drew back , instinctively , as she once again rose , slowly and stiffly , into a sitting posture ; then , clutching the coverlid with both hands , muttered some indistinct sounds in her throat , and fell lifeless on the bed said one of the old women , hurrying in as soon as the door was opened rejoined the matron , walking carelessly away .
