# text = There was no sound of their whereabout , when the Dodger descended the stairs , bearing the light in his hand , and followed by a man in a coarse smock-frock ; who , after casting a hurried glance round the room , pulled off a large wrapper which had concealed the lower portion of his face , and disclosed : all haggard , unwashed , and unshorn : the features of flash Toby Crackit said this worthy , nodding to the Jew With these words he pulled up the smock-frock ; and , winding it round his middle , drew a chair to the fire , and placed his feet upon the hob he said , pointing disconsolately to his top boots
