# text = Succeeding , at length , in catching the eye of the man who occupied the chair , he beckoned to him slightly , and left the room , as quietly as he had entered it inquired the man , as he followed him out to the landing The Jew shook his head impatiently , and said in a whisper replied the man inquired Fagin replied the landlord of the Cripples ; for it was he asked the Jew , laying the same emphasis on the pronoun as before inquired the landlord , hesitating said the Jew replied the man , drawing a gold watch from his fob said the Jew , hastily ; as though , however desirous he might be to see the person in question , he was nevertheless relieved by his absence said the man said the Jew , descending the stairs said the other , looking over the rails , and speaking in a hoarse whisper said the Jew , looking up The landlord reciprocated the old man's laugh ; and returned to his guests .
