# text = He appeared somewhat reassured , on beholding her in the same listless attitude from which he had first roused her croaked the Jew , in his usual voice replied the girl , raising her head languidly said the Jew , rubbing the palms of his hands nervously together interrupted Nancy , hastily observed the Jew , keeping his glistening eye steadily upon her rejoined Nancy Fagin put several other questions : all with the same drift of ascertaining whether the girl had profited by his unguarded hints ; but , she answered them so readily , and was withal so utterly unmoved by his searching looks , that his original impression of her being more than a trifle in liquor , was confirmed .
