# text = While it was being disposed of , she acquainted Mr . Bumble with the old woman's decease said that gentleman , sipping his peppermint said the lady evasively urged Mr . Bumble rejoined the lady exclaimed Mr . Bumble interposed the lady , hastily continued Mr . Bumble responded the lady said Mr . Bumble , clenching his fist Unembellished by any violence of gesticulation , this might have seemed no very high compliment to the lady's charms ; but , as Mr . Bumble accompanied the threat with many warlike gestures , she was much touched with this proof of his devotion , and protested , with great admiration , that he was indeed a dove .
