# text = Sikes , again looking round , could discern that the men who had given chase were already climbing the gate of the field in which he stood ; and that a couple of dogs were some paces in advance of them cried Toby With this parting advice , Mr . Crackit , preferring the chance of being shot by his friend , to the certainty of being taken by his enemies , fairly turned tail , and darted off at full speed .
