# text = Three men , who had by this time advanced some distance into the field , stopped to take counsel together said the fattest man of the party said a shorter man ; who was by no means of a slim figure , and who was very pale in the face , and very polite : as frightened men frequently are said the third , who had called the dogs back replied the shorter man To tell the truth , the little man _did_ seem to know his situation , and to know perfectly well that it was by no means a desirable one ; for his teeth chattered in his head as he spoke said Mr . Giles said Brittles said Giles said Brittles said Mr . Giles .
