# text = The cook and housemaid simultaneously ejaculated and drew their chairs closer together resumed Mr . Giles Here , all eyes were turned upon Brittles , who fixed his upon the speaker , and stared at him , with his mouth wide open , and his face expressive of the most unmitigated horror said Giles , throwing away the table-cloth , and looking very hard at the cook and housemaid murmured the tinker said Giles , turning upon him , and laying great emphasis on the word observed Brittles , in a low voice continued Giles asked the cook replied Mr . Giles observed the housemaid retorted Brittles , plucking up a little said Mr . Giles , nodding his head , approvingly Mr . Giles had risen from his seat , and taken two steps with his eyes shut , to accompany his description with appropriate action , when he started violently , in common with the rest of the company , and hurried back to his chair .
