# text = The cook and housemaid screamed said Mr . Giles , assuming perfect serenity Nobody moved said Mr . Giles , surveying the pale faces which surrounded him , and looking very blank himself Mr . Giles , as he spoke , looked at Brittles ; but that young man , being naturally modest , probably considered himself nobody , and so held that the inquiry could not have any application to him ; at all events , he tendered no reply .
