# text = The doctor seemed expecially troubled by the fact of the robbery having been unexpected , and attempted in the night-time ; as if it were the established custom of gentlemen in the housebreaking way to transact business at noon , and to make an appointment , by post , a day or two previous said the doctor , turning to the young lady said Rose , interrupting him replied the doctor Mr . Giles , who had been feverishly putting the tea-cups to rights , blushed very red , and said that he had had that honour said the doctor Mr . Giles , who thought this light treatment of the matter an unjust attempt at diminishing his glory , answered respectfully , that it was not for the like of him to judge about that ; but he rather thought it was no joke to the opposite party said the doctor Talking all the way , he followed Mr . Giles upstairs ; and while he is going upstairs , the reader may be informed , that Mr . Losberne , a surgeon in the neighbourhood , known through a circuit of ten miles round as had grown fat , more from good-humour than from good living : and was as kind and hearty , and withal as eccentric an old bachelor , as will be found in five times that space , by any explorer alive .
