# text = Oh ! if when we oppress and grind our fellow-creatures , we bestowed but one thought on the dark evidences of human error , which , like dense and heavy clouds , are rising , slowly it is true , but not less surely , to Heaven , to pour their after-vengeance on our heads ; if we heard but one instant , in imagination , the deep testimony of dead men's voices , which no power can stifle , and no pride shut out ; where would be the injury and injustice , the suffering , misery , cruelty , and wrong , that each day's life brings with it !
