# text = He said , if that wasn't law , he would be glad to know what was thundered the doctor Brittles looked doubtfully at Mr . Giles ; Mr . Giles looked doubtfully at Brittles ; the constable put his hand behind his ear , to catch the reply ; the two women and the tinker leaned forward to listen ; the doctor glanced keenly round ; when a ring was heard at the gate , and at the same moment , the sound of wheels cried Brittles , to all appearance much relieved exclaimed the doctor , aghast in his turn replied Brittles , taking up a candle cried the doctor replied Brittles said the doctor , walking away inquired Brittles , opening the door a little way , with the chain up , and peeping out , shading the candle with his hand replied a man outside Much comforted by this assurance , Brittles opened the door to its full width , and confronted a portly man in a great-coat ; who walked in , without saying anything more , and wiped his shoes on the mat , as coolly as if he lived there said the officer ; ' he's in the gig , a-minding the prad .
