# text = Chickweed in apprehending the man as robbed his house . " I see him , Spyers ," said Chickweed , " pass my house yesterday morning ," " Why didn't you up , and collar him !" says Spyers . " I was so struck all of a heap , that you might have fractured my skull with a toothpick ," says the poor man ; " but we're sure to have him ; for between ten and eleven o'clock at night he passed again ."
