# text = When they came to Chertsey Bridge , Oliver turned very pale , and uttered a loud exclamation cried the doctor , as usual , all in a bustle cried Oliver , pointing out of the carriage window cried the doctor whispered Oliver cried the doctor But , before the coachman could dismount from his box , he had tumbled out of the coach , by some means or other ; and , running down to the deserted tenement , began kicking at the door like a madman said a little ugly hump-backed man : opening the door so suddenly , that the doctor , from the very impetus of his last kick , nearly fell forward into the passage exclaimed the other , collaring him , without a moment's reflection replied the hump-backed man , coolly said the doctor , giving his captive a hearty shake
