# text = When Mr . Bumble had scrupulously examined the coins , to see that they were genuine , and had put them up , with much satisfaction , in his waistcoat-pocket , he went on said Mr . Bumble said Mr . Bumble , not quite following the stranger's excited description said the stranger observed Mr . Bumble , shaking his head , despondingly cried the stranger ; ' I speak of one ; a meek-looking , pale-faced boy , who was apprenticed down here , to a coffin-maker -- I wish he had made his coffin , and screwed his body in it -- and who afterwards ran away to London , as it was supposed said Mr . Bumble said the stranger , stopping Mr . Bumble in the outset of a tirade on the subject of poor Oliver's vices said Mr . Bumble , whom the gin-and-water had rendered facetious demanded the stranger , sternly rejoined Mr . Bumble .
