# text = He was preparing to ascend a steep staircase , or rather ladder , leading to another floor of warehouses above : when a bright flash of lightning streamed down the aperture , and a peal of thunder followed , which shook the crazy building to its centre he cried , shrinking back He remained silent for a few moments ; and then , removing his hands suddenly from his face , showed , to the unspeakable discomposure of Mr . Bumble , that it was much distorted and discoloured said Monks , observing his alarm
