# text = The sickly rays of the suspended lantern falling directly upon them , aggravated the paleness and anxiety of their countenances : which , encircled by the deepest gloom and darkness , looked ghastly in the extreme the matron began asked Monks , in the same hollow whisper replied the woman said Monks , regarding her attentively resumed the matron said Monks , with quivering lip , and glancing over his shoulder said the matron , nodding carelessly towards her husband asked Monks replied the woman , with something like a shudder cried Monks , with desperate eagerness said the matron cried Monks , in a voice which , from its very suppression , seemed only the more furious said the woman , to all appearance unmoved ( as Mr . Bumble was very far from being ) by the strange man's violence interposed Monks , stretching forward replied the woman demanded Monks said the woman asked Monks quickly replied the woman .
