# text = The kind tone of this answer , the sweet voice , the gentle manner , the absence of any accent of haughtiness or displeasure , took the girl completely by surprise , and she burst into tears she said , clasping her hands passionately before her face said Rose , earnestly said the girl , still weeping said Rose , recoiling a few steps , as if to be nearer assistance in case she should require it said the girl said Rose Maylie replied the girl said Rose , involuntarily falling from her strange companion cried the girl said Rose , in a broken voice rejoined the girl said Rose replied the girl said Rose rejoined the girl said Rose pursued the girl asked Rose said the girl said Rose replied the girl exclaimed Rose said Nancy , glancing uneasily round , as she had scarcely ceased to do , since she began to speak , for a vision of Sikes haunted her perpetually said Rose , turning very pale replied the girl , shaking her head said Rose said the girl said Rose said the earnest girl , folding her hands as the tears coursed down her face cried the girl , sinking on her knees said Rose cried the girl , writhing in agony of her mind asked Rose cried the girl cried Rose answered the girl said Rose rejoined the girl , rising said Rose rejoined the girl asked Rose asked the girl answered Rose said the girl without hesitation interposed Rose , as the girl moved hurriedly towards the door replied the girl steadily said Rose , after a pause replied the girl , waving her hand said Rose , stepping gently forward replied the girl , wringing her hands
