# text = She had taken up the same pen , and laid it down again fifty times , and had considered and reconsidered the first line of her letter without writing the first word , when Oliver , who had been walking in the streets , with Mr . Giles for a body-guard , entered the room in such breathless haste and violent agitation , as seemed to betoken some new cause of alarm asked Rose , advancing to meet him replied the boy said Rose , soothing him replied Oliver , scarcely able to articulate asked Rose replied Oliver , shedding tears of delight said Oliver , opening a scrap of paper With her attention not a little distracted by these and a great many other incoherent exclamations of joy , Rose read the address , which was Craven Street , in the Strand .
