# text = At no great distance from whom , was seated another old gentleman , in nankeen breeches and gaiters ; who did not look particularly benevolent , and who was sitting with his hands clasped on the top of a thick stick , and his chin propped thereupon said the gentleman , in the bottle-green coat , hastily rising with great politeness said Rose , glancing from the other gentleman to the one who had spoken said the old gentleman interposed Miss Maylie Mr . Brownlow inclined his head .
