# text = Now , this back-room was immediately behind the bar , and some steps lower , so that any person connected with the house , undrawing a small curtain which concealed a single pane of glass fixed in the wall of the last-named apartment , about five feet from its flooring , could not only look down upon any guests in the back-room without any great hazard of being observed ( the glass being in a dark angle of the wall , between which and a large upright beam the observer had to thrust himself ), but could , by applying his ear to the partition , ascertain with tolerable distinctness , their subject of conversation .
