# text = And very amiable he looked , and a very low bow he made , as he advanced , and setting himself down at the nearest table , ordered something to drink of the grinning Barney said Fagin , rubbing his hands asked Noah Claypole replied Fagin , pointing from Noah's shoes to those of his companion , and from them to the two bundles said Noah replied the Jew , sinking his voice to a confidential whisper Fagin followed up this remark by striking the side of his nose with his right forefinger ,-- a gesture which Noah attempted to imitate , though not with complete success , in consequence of his own nose not being large enough for the purpose .
