# text = Whether Noah Claypole , whose rapacity was none of the least comprehensive , would have acceded even to these glowing terms , had he been a perfectly free agent , is very doubtful ; but as he recollected that , in the event of his refusal , it was in the power of his new acquaintance to give him up to justice immediately ( and more unlikely things had come to pass ), he gradually relented , and said he thought that would suit him observed Noah suggested Fagin replied Noah said Fagin rejoined Mr . Claypole slowly observed the Jew , ruminating or pretending to ruminate asked Noah , anxiously regarding him asked Fagin asked Noah , shaking his head said Fagin , laying his hand on Noah's knee demanded Mr . Claypole said Fagin roared Mr . Claypole , kicking up his legs in an ecstasy replied Fagin With this , Fagin poked Mr . Claypole in the side , and they joined in a burst of laughter both long and loud said Noah , when he had recovered himself , and Charlotte had returned asked Fagin , adding , as Mr . Claypole nodded assent replied Noah , who had prepared himself for such emergency said Fagin , bowing with grotesque politeness thundered Mr . Claypole replied Mrs .
