# text = It's number one cried Mr . Bolter said Fagin , who felt it necessary to qualify this position exclaimed Mr . Bolter pursued Fagin , affecting to disregard this interruption replied Mr . Bolter said Mr . Bolter , who was largely endowed with the quality of selfishness retorted Fagin interrupted Mr . Bolter said Fagin , shrugging his shoulders , and stretching out his hands Mr . Bolter put his hand to his neckerchief , as if he felt it inconveniently tight ; and murmured an assent , qualified in tone but not in substance continued Fagin replied Mr . Bolter said the Jew , raising his eyebrows rejoined Mr . Bolter , thoughtfully Mr . Fagin saw , with delight , that this tribute to his powers was no mere compliment , but that he had really impressed his recruit with a sense of his wily genius , which it was most important that he should entertain in the outset of their acquaintance .
