# text = Bolter would have been informed that they represented that combination of words when the dialogue was cut short by the entry of Master Bates , with his hands in his breeches-pockets , and his face twisted into a look of semi-comical woe said Charley , when he and his new companion had been made known to each other replied Master Bates With this expression of feeling for his unfortunate friend , Master Bates sat himself on the nearest chair with an aspect of chagrin and despondency exclaimed Fagin , darting an angry look at his pupil replied Master Bates , in a voice rendered husky by regret replied Fagin angrily Cause it isn't on the rec-ord , is it ?' said Charley , chafed into perfect defiance of his venerable friend by the current of his regrets ; '' cause it can't come out in the ' dictment cried Fagin , extending his right hand , and turning to Mr .
