# text = Noah Claypole , or Morris Bolter as the reader pleases , punctually followed the directions he had received , which -- Master Bates being pretty well acquainted with the locality -- were so exact that he was enabled to gain the magisterial presence without asking any question , or meeting with any interruption by the way .
