# text = He found himself jostled among a crowd of people , chiefly women , who were huddled together in a dirty frowsy room , at the upper end of which was a raised platform railed off from the rest , with a dock for the prisoners on the left hand against the wall , a box for the witnesses in the middle , and a desk for the magistrates on the right ; the awful locality last named , being screened off by a partition which concealed the bench from the common gaze , and left the vulgar to imagine ( if they could ) the full majesty of justice .
