# text = He had also remarked a young gentleman in the throng , particularly active in making his way about , and that young gentleman was the prisoner before him said the magistrate replied the Dodger inquired the jailer , nudging the silent Dodger with his elbow said the Dodger , looking up with an air of abstraction observed the officer with a grin replied the Dodger interposed the clerk said the jailer replied the Dodger , brushing his hat with the palm of his hand . ' Ah ! ( to the Bench ) it's no use your looking frightened ; I won't show you no mercy , not a ha'porth of it .
