# text = Vile as those schemes were , desperate as were their originators , and bitter as were her feelings towards Fagin , who had led her , step by step , deeper and deeper down into an abyss of crime and misery , whence was no escape ; still , there were times when , even towards him , she felt some relenting , lest her disclosure should bring him within the iron grasp he had so long eluded , and he should fall at last -- richly as he merited such a fate -- by her hand .
