# text = The old man was up , betimes , next morning , and waited impatiently for the appearance of his new associate , who after a delay that seemed interminable , at length presented himself , and commenced a voracious assault on the breakfast said Fagin , drawing up a chair and seating himself opposite Morris Bolter returned Noah said Fagin , cursing his dear young friend's greediness from the very bottom of his heart said Noah , cutting a monstrous slice of bread said Fagin said Noah There seemed , indeed , no great fear of anything interrupting him , as he had evidently sat down with a determination to do a great deal of business said Fagin said Mr . Bolter remarked Mr . Bolter complacently Fagin affected to laugh very heartily ; and Mr . Bolter having had his laugh out , took a series of large bites , which finished his first hunk of bread and butter , and assisted himself to a second said Fagin , leaning over the table rejoined Bolter said the Jew demanded Mr . Bolter replied Fagin said Bolter asked Noah , setting down his cup , and looking his employer , eagerly , in the face said Fagin , wishing to interest him in the scent as much as possible inquired Noah cried Noah , curling up his nose replied Fagin said Noah cried Fagin , elated by the success of his proposal replied Noah said Fagin
