# text = The gentleman , shortly afterwards , addressed himself to her he said replied Nancy asked the old gentleman replied the girl , shaking her head inquired the gentleman said the gentleman replied the girl , as he paused for a moment the gentleman began said the girl earnestly said the gentleman cried the girl , recoiling said the gentleman replied the girl said the gentleman , who seemed fully prepared for this answer returned the girl rejoined the girl firmly said the gentleman , quickly , as if this had been the point he had been aiming to attain suggested the girl pursued the gentleman asked the girl replied Rose said the girl , after a short pause replied the gentleman said the girl after another interval of silence After receiving an assurance from both , that she might safely do so , she proceeded in a voice so low that it was often difficult for the listener to discover even the purport of what she said , to describe , by name and situation , the public-house whence she had been followed that night .
