# text = As he expressed himself to this effect , with assumed carelessness , he took a step or two nearer the concealed spy , as the latter could tell from the distinctness with which he heard him mutter he said , returning : so it seemed by the sound : to the spot where he had stood before replied Nancy rejoined the gentleman , with a voice and emphasis of kindness that might have touched a much harder and more obdurate heart rejoined the girl , weeping said the gentleman cried the young lady said the gentleman replied the girl , after a short struggle she said , looking hastily round repeated the young lady , with great stress upon the word rejoined the girl said the gentleman , with a sigh urged the girl cried the young lady repeated the girl returned the young lady , sobbing replied the girl The gentleman turned away cried the young lady replied the girl The violent agitation of the girl , and the apprehension of some discovery which would subject her to ill-usage and violence , seemed to determine the gentleman to leave her , as she requested .
