# text = Soon he was up again , and away ,-- not far into the country , but back towards London by the high-road -- then back again -- then over another part of the same ground as he already traversed -- then wandering up and down in fields , and lying on ditches' brinks to rest , and starting up to make for some other spot , and do the same , and ramble on again .
