# text = The men obeyed , and the two were left alone together said Monks , throwing down his hat and cloak returned Mr . Brownlow asked the other , after contemplating , half in silence , and half in dogged wonder , the agitation of his companion replied Mr . Brownlow said Monks ( to retain his assumed designation ) after a long silence , during which he had jerked himself in sullen defiance to and fro , and Mr . Brownlow had sat , shading his face with his hand said Mr . Brownlow , rousing himself replied Monks said Mr . Brownlow interrupted Monks with a jeering laugh pursued the old gentleman said Monks returned Mr . Brownlow said Monks , turning away his eyes and beating his foot upon the ground , as a man who is determined to deny everything returned Mr . Brownlow rejoined Monks said Mr . Brownlow asked Monks said Mr . Brownlow , without seeming to hear the interruption
