# text = As Mr . Brownlow paused , he changed his position with the air of one who has experienced a sudden relief , and wiped his hot face and hands said Mr . Brownlow , slowly , and fixing his eyes upon the other's face interrupted MOnks in a tone intended to appear incredulous , but savouring more of disagreeable surprise said Mr . Brownlow , after a short pause Monks drew his breath yet more freely , and looked round with a smile of triumph said Mr . Brownlow , drawing nearer to the other's chair cried Monks said Mr . Brownlow asked Monks hastily replied Mr . Brownlow stammered Monks returned the old gentleman with a searching glance said Monks , rising boldly replied Mr . Brownlow , rising too returned the coward , overwhelmed by these accumulated charges cried the gentleman interposed Monks replied Mr . Brownlow replied Monks said Mr . Brownlow While Monks was pacing up and down , meditating with dark and evil looks on this proposal and the possibilities of evading it : torn by his fears on the one hand and his hatred on the other : the door was hurriedly unlocked , and a gentleman ( Mr . Losberne ) entered the room in violent agitation he cried asked Mr . Brownlow replied the other said Mr . Brownlow replied the doctor said Mr . Brownlow asked Mr . Brownlow , in a low voice , of Monks he replied
