# text = But if Oliver , under these influences , had remained silent while they journeyed towards his birth-place by a road he had never seen , how the whole current of his recollections ran back to old times , and what a crowd of emotions were wakened up in his breast , when they turned into that which he had traversed on foot : a poor houseless , wandering boy , without a friend to help him , or a roof to shelter his head cried Oliver , eagerly clasping the hand of Rose , and pointing out at the carriage window replied Rose , gently taking his folded hands between her own said Oliver Rose nodded for the boy was smiling through such happy tears that she could not speak said Oliver cried the boy with a burst of affectionate emotion
